<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-01T09:33:00.941Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to assault communities in Zamfara, with police repelling an attack in Bukuyum and finding over 30 bodies of suspected bandits. In Plateau, gunmen attacked a military checkpoint, killing a soldier and stealing weapons, and a separate community attack left a soldier with machete wounds and two civilians with gunshot injuries. Security forces also killed dozens of gang members in an unspecified operation and reported a gun battle in Zamfara that resulted in over 30 suspected bandits killed. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPZ3NJbW9RMmVEVngzSUhYX0luUDE2eUQtWFhiMkdrbkRYQzNQaldGdXV0UTNJaFp4akI2MC1JZVJTOFBOOXY0U1RBTHlEbTQ3UFp4YUNWMHhKblZJV1A3STJXYTk2TzVhSHVaQlM2ZlZHWFI3WjNFcWlNeFFPRGUwWW5lR3RISDFaMVZlOXlrRS1sZ2NwbXh1WENaYURFTjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOd21oQjZndUR6WUgwMXl4TEhWZmJxSkFYSGdySUQ1Q2VSdUg0bTBETUY3dlNGVEZUaUcwemhfbTFpNUQzbEZVaHpybmhKRlljajhzNFJ2eEN4aWJPQmFrODBzblpkMUJMekV6eG1oN1BYWFdXWjRsUDJRSHRiQzl5bS1mQlEyaVBoV3FOdWdCMHZja2dUSU1fakktYVFHejdNekYxS2FDOS1HR3d4LVRMWERWZGlnN3ZkTThzS1YtV3B2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPcG1WNFFwak9aalBtcTZjWmxhRzF5VUZ3RUhkVmlWa0t4ZkN1Qnd0YWRka2lmWFFnbFlEVlpmY3Z2RGFEWHk5VkR4LVBXQm1IUXdhcUJRVTFiXzgyYU1scnhlUzJhQ3F1SHBNSVl6MVVqdzlhX1JrbjNUWTJ6SEFTRzdpRUpZTDZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOQ0tKdlhIY3VkczlRX3VxV1B2YzUwTURhSUJRRTFieC1PMXhpaFRuLVl1NzdkNzVHUzlvM1ZlOWNVd0R1Ynlsb0tCNjA1cXhCbXkzbHBJVXVCZENvU1FpVEk2bEhBcE5razBs